{"product":{"id":6980764139694,"title":"Norix Rocksmart Rocking Chair","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eRockSmart is a contemporary rocking chair designed from the ground up for soothing comfort, exceptional durability and aesthetic appeal. Its signature one-piece shape is sculpted from rotationally-molded polyethylene for a calming, safe and comfortable rock. Easily cleanable and highly durable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e16\" rocker\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverall dimensions: 40.2”D x 25.5”W x 41.4”H\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSeat dimensions: 17.5”H x 20.5”W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 49 lbs (Model RA16) or 71 lbs (Model RA16-71 )\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e18\" rocker\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverall dimensions: 45”D x 27”W x 44”H\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSeat dimensions: 18.5”H x 21.8”W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 51 lbs (Model RA18) or 71 lbs (Model RA18-71)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGenerous arc provides a relaxing and safe rocking action\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecurely affixed nylon runners protect floors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRear bumper indicates the limits of safe rocking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLigature resistant design with no internal openings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e Options:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandard weight or heavy weight models\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable without securely runners\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Twilight, Cove, Sage, Clay, Sand, Dove\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Norix Furniture:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNorix Group specializes in providing high quality, intensive-use institutional furniture designed specifically for behavioral health care facilities, hospitals, jails, prisons, detention centers, and other challenging markets. Norix humanizes behavioral and correctional facilities, while building extreme durability and security into each piece of institutional furniture so it stands up to correctional grade use. Norix Progress furniture is as tough as your prison or detention grade environment, yet safe for trustees and staff. Anchortex supplies the complete line of Norix furniture for patient rooms, classrooms, inmate cells, day rooms, lobbies, intake areas, chapels, dining halls, outdoor\/recreation, contact visitation and video-visitation areas, as well as public safety furniture for police and fire stations that looks good and stands up to hard use. Norix meets or exceeds testing requirements for intensive-use institutional and detention grade furniture, and the everyday test of use at healthcare and detention institutions by people who don't necessarily have the best interests of the institutional furniture in mind.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix Furniture","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-06-10T11:27:55-04:00","handle":"norix-rocksmart-rocking-chair","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:53-05:00","published_at":"2021-06-14T18:20:47-04:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, detention-furniture","variants":[{"id":40472254218414,"product_id":6980764139694,"title":"RA16 - 16\" Standard","price":"1161.60","sku":"ADS-N700216-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"1452.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"RA16 - 16\" Standard","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-07-02T17:09:51-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:53-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":115666,"image_id":null,"weight":255.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},